msgid "telnet was not found. Add “Telnet Client” from Windows “Optional features”, or run `Enable-WindowsOptionalFeature -Online -FeatureName TelnetClient` in PowerShell as an administrator."
msgstr "No se encontró telnet. Agregue “Cliente Telnet” desde “Características opcionales” de Windows o ejecute `Enable-WindowsOptionalFeature -Online -FeatureName TelnetClient` en PowerShell como administrador."

